OL,3,GNEWSADriver, 91, dies after suspected
OL,4,Amedical episode
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 91-year-old man has died after the
OL,7,Fcar he was driving left the road and
OL,8,Fended up in a shallow ditch in North
OL,9,FYorkshire.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,12,Fsingle-vehicle crash involving a grey
OL,13,FVolvo XC60 between Little Edstone and
OL,14,FMarton, near Kirkbymoorside, at about
OL,15,F17:00 BST on Tuesday.
OL,17,FNorth Yorkshire Police said the
OL,18,Fcollision may have resulted from a
OL,19,Fmedical episode. The driver was
OL,20,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
